<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25635" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπρέπ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>appear prominent</i> or <i>conspicuous, strike the eye,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				351
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπρέπον κακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					1007
				</span></i>
			(lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be eminent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.513
				</span></i>
			(<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Salt.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				68.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλλει, ὥρας ἀκμῇ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.771e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				42.34
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πάντων ἀψυχία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					642
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>to be suitable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτητικὴ λεχθεῖσα ἂν διαπρέψειεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					219c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc. rei,
				<i>adorn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				185
			</span></i>.</div>
